Modifications: Katalyst Nord AB converted the published Paddle inference files to ONNX
with paddle2onnx (opset 14), and wrote the recogniser's character dictionary out as
Unicode code points in rec-chars.json. The weights are not otherwise changed. The conversion is reproduced by
tools/ocr-model/build.sh in the PlotTracer source.

The models are run by ONNX Runtime Web (onnxruntime-web), Copyright (c) Microsoft
Corporation, licensed under the MIT License (see onnxruntime/LICENSE). Its third-party
notices are in onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt, copied from the v1.30.0 release with one
change: a section separator drawn with two dash characters is written in the file's own
"_____" separator style. No licence text is altered.
